Conjuring Tapes is a horror, mystery film directed by Randy Nundlall Jr..

3
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:16,000
While sorting through their late friend's belongings, two women discover VHS tapes showing them in haunting,
unfamiliar scenes, each one drawing them into the grasp of a mysterious, malevolent entity.

