10
00:43:53,333 --> 00:43:59,333
The Conjuring Universe is an American horror franchise and shared
universe centered on a series of supernatural horror films.

11
00:48:16,666 --> 00:48:22,666
The franchise is produced by New Line Cinema, Atomic Monster, and
the Safran Company, and distributed by Warner Bros.

12
00:52:40,000 --> 00:52:46,000
The films present a dramatization of the supposedly real-life adventures of Ed and Lorraine Warren,
paranormal investigators and authors associated with prominent yet controversial cases of haunting.

13
00:57:03,333 --> 00:57:09,333
The main series follows their attempts to help people harassed by spirits, while the spin-off
films focus on the origins of some of the entities the Warrens have encountered.

14
01:01:26,666 --> 01:01:32,666
The franchise has been commercially successful, grossing $2.7 billion against a combined
budget of $263 million and becoming the highest-grossing horror franchise to date.

15
01:05:49,999 --> 01:05:55,999
The franchise has received mixed reviews.

16
01:10:13,333 --> 01:10:19,333
The film explores themes of evil, found footage, mysterious
events, malevolent spirit, paranormal horror.

17
01:14:36,666 --> 01:14:42,666
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
